2×350 +300)/1000 ×0.12 = (700+300)/1000×0.12=1000/1000×0.12=0.12 $/h\n- 故障 =0.2×2100/26280=420/26280≈0.016 $/h\n- c_hour=0.1241+0.12+0.016≈0.2601 $/h\n\nt_prefill =594e12/(2×71e12×0.45×0.81) =594/(2×71×0.45×0.81) 秒？注意单位，594e12是TFLOP？可能这里的单位需要确认。题面中t_prefill的公式是594e12 / (n_cards × TF_peak × 0.45 × 0.81)。TF_peak是TFLOPS，所以分母是n_cards × TFLOPS × 0.45 ×0.81，分子是594e12 FLOP？可能这里的594e12是594 TFLOP，即594×1e12 FLOP。所以t_prefill的单位是秒，因为FLOP / (FLOP/s) = s。\n\n例如，n_cards=2，TF_peak=71 TFLOPS=71e12 FLOP/s。分母=2×71e12×0.45×0.81=2×71×0.45×0.81 e12 = 2×71×0.3645 e12 ≈ 2×25.8795 e12 ≈51.759e12 FLOP/s。分子594e12 FLOP。所以t_prefill=594/51.759≈11.48秒。\n\nt_decode =655 × (14 +1×24.7)/(2×936×0.8×0.81) =655×38.7/(2×936×0.648) =655×38.7/(2×606.528) =655×38.7/1213.056 ≈655×0.0319 ≈20.89秒？ 但t_decode是总时间，然后除以n得到每流的时间。t_task = t_prefill + t_decode/n. 这里n=1，所以t_task=11.48 +20.89/1=32.37秒。λ_raw=3600/32.37≈111.2 task/hour.\n\nc_pass = c_hour/(U×λ_raw×G) ×100 =0.2601/(0.35×111.2×0.68) ×100. 分母=0.35×111.2=38.92; 38.92×0.68≈26.4656. 0.2601/26.4656≈0.00983. ×100=0.983 ¢/task.\n\n类似地，计算其他配置的c_pass，然后比较。\n\n但这里需要注意的是，t_decode的公式是655 × (W_bytes + n×24.7) / (n_cards × BW_peak × 0.80 × 0.81). 这里的BW_peak是峰值带宽，单位GB/s，而W_bytes是GB，所以分子是token数×GB，分母是GB/s，所以结果是秒。例如，W4=14GB，n=1，n_cards=2，BW_peak=936 GB/s. 分子=655×(14+24.7)=655×38.7=25348.5 GB·tokens. 分母=2×936×0.8×0.81=2×936×0.648=2×606.528=1213.056 GB/s. 所以t_decode=25348.5 /1213.056 ≈20.89秒。正确。\n\n然后t_task = t_prefill + t_decode/n. 这里n是并发流数，所以t_decode是总时间，除以n得到每流的decode时间。例如，n=1时，t_decode/n=20.89秒。n=2时，t_decode/n= (655×(14+2×24.7))/(4×936×0.8×0.81) /2 ? 不，t_decode的公式是总时间，所以t_decode =655×(W +n×24.7)/(n_cards×BW×0.8×0.81). 然后t_task = t_prefill + t_decode/n. 例如，n_cards=4，n=2，W=14. t_decode=655×(14+2×24.7)/(4×936×0.8×0.81)=655×(14+49.4)=655×63.4=41527. 分母=4×936×0.648=4×606.528=2426.112. t_decode=41527/2426.112≈17.12秒. t_task = t_prefill +17.12/2. t_prefill=594e12/(4×71e12×0.45×0.81)=594/(4×71×0.3645)=594/(4×25.8795)=594/103.518≈5.74秒. t_task=5.74 +17.12/2=5.74+8.56=14.3秒. λ_raw=3600/14.3≈251.75 task/hour.\n\n然后计算c_pass。例如，RTX 3090 4卡 W4:\ngpu_price=1050×4=4200\n摊销=(4200+2000-4200×0.4)/26280=(6200-1680)/26280=4520/26280≈0.172 $/h\n电费=(4×350+300)/1000×0.12=(1400+300)/1000×0.12=1700/1000×0.12=0.204 $/h\n故障=0.2×4200/26280=840/26280≈0.032 $/h\nc_hour=0.172+0.204+0.032=0.408 $/h\nλ_raw=251.75\nc_pass=0.408/(0.35×251.75×0.68)×100. 分母=0.35×251.75=88.1125; ×0.68≈59.9165. 0.408/59.9165≈0.00681. ×100=0.681 ¢/task. 比2卡的0.983更低，所以4卡更优。\n\n同样计算V100的配置。例如，V100 4卡 W4:\ngpu_price=704×4=2816\n摊销=(2816+2000-2816×0.4)/26280=(4816-1126.4)/26280=3689.6/26280≈0.1404 $/h\n电费=(4×250+300)/1000×0.12=(1000+300)/1000×0.12=1300/1000×0.12=0.156 $/h\n故障=0.2×2816/26280=563.2/26280≈0.0214 $/h\nc_hour=0.1404+0.156+0.0214≈0.3178 $/h\nt_prefill=594e12/(4×125e12×0.45×0.81)=594/(4×125×0.3645)=594/(4×45.5625)=594/182.25≈3.26秒\nt_decode=655×(14+2×24.7)/(4×900×0.8×0.81)=655×63.4/(4×900×0.648)=41527/(4×583.2)=41527/2332.8≈17.80秒\nt_task=3.26 +17.80/2=3.26+8.90=12.16秒\nλ_raw=3600/12.16≈296.05 task/hour\nc_pass=0.3178/(0.35×296.05×0.68)×100. 分母=0.35×296.05=103.6175; ×0.68≈70.46. 0.3178/70.46≈0.00451. ×100=0.451 ¢/task. 比RTX 3090 4卡的0.681更低，所以V100 4卡更优。\n\n继续计算其他配置，例如V100 2卡 W4:\ngpu_price=704×2=1408\n摊销=(1408+2000-1408×0.4)/26280=(3408-563.2)/26280=2844.8/26280≈0.1083 $/h\n电费=(2×250+300)/1000×0.12=800/1000×0.12=0.096 $/h\n故障=0.2×1408/26280=281.6/26280≈0.0107 $/h\nc_hour=0.1083+0.096+0.0107≈0.215 $/h\nt_prefill=594e12/(2×125e12×0.45×0.81)=594/(2×125×0.3645)=594/(91.125)=6.52秒\nt_decode=655×(14+24.7)/(2×900×0.8×0.81)=655×38.7/(2×900×0.648)=25348.5/(1166.4)=21.73秒\nt_task=6.52 +21.73/1=28.25秒\nλ_raw=3600/28.25≈127.43\nc_pass=0.215/(0.35×127.43×0.68)×100. 分母=0.35×127.43=44.6005; ×0.68≈30.328. 0.215/30.328≈0.00709. ×100=0.709 ¢/task. 比4卡的0.451高，所以4卡更优。\n\nV100 3卡 W4:\nn=floor(3/2)=1\ngpu_price=704×3=2112\n摊销=(2112+2000-2112×0.4)/26280=(4112-844.8)/26280=3267.2/26280≈0.1243 $/h\n电费=(3×250+300)/1000×0.12=1050/1000×0.12=0.126 $/h\n故障=0.2×2112/26280=422.4/26280≈0.0161 $/h\nc_hour=0.1243+0.1